"Privacy details" = "Your credentials are sent only to the official portal. Remembering them is optional and stores them in the iOS Keychain. Guest data and optional photos are stored on this device with iOS file protection, subject to the selected retention period. Expired data is removed when accessed. Signing out clears credentials and cached guest data. Clear cache removes local guests and photos. Turning off photo storage removes saved photos. Exports can contain personal data; files you share or save outside this app are managed by their destination. The embedded portal browser uses an ephemeral session. This app includes no analytics or advertising SDK. SMS reports are handed to the system composer and sent through your carrier only after you confirm. The app cannot read service replies; enter received confirmation codes manually.";
